   "lines": [
    "I very much like my",
    "fellow members as",
    "a whole, especially",
    "those from the country;",
    "the city members are",
    "of a much poorer",
    "stamp, especially the",
    "democrats, who are",
    "mainly Irishmen",
    "The wrangling goes",
    "on with great",
    "bitterness between",
    "the Tammany and",
    "Anti tammany",
    "factions, while we",
    "Republicans can",
    "look on with indifference."
   ],
